  "id": "paralexia",
  "term": "paralexia",
  "definition": "Paralexia is a disorder of reading, especially of silent or internal reading, described as a frequent symptom in word-deafness. In this historical usage, it reflects impaired understanding of words during reading because visual word signs do not properly call up their usual auditory word memories.",
